      children: [(0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(_components.strong, {
        children: "Osho Darshan:"
      }), " The qualifications accumulate like a portrait being painted: pure, self-conquered, senses subdued, and finally — the deepest brushstroke — the self that is the Self of all beings. Osho says this last is the secret of untouchability: you cannot be tainted by others when you have become others. The businessman who sees himself in his customers cannot cheat them; the doctor who sees himself in the patient cannot hurry. Taint comes from the gap — the belief that \"I\" and \"they\" are different substances. Close the gap, and nothing can stick."]
